`M oodac/llvm_emit_binop.oo`, `M oodac/llvm_emit_env.oo`,
`M oodac/llvm_emit_fn.oo`, `M oodac/llvm_emit_preamble.oo`,
`M oodac/llvm_emit_ty.oo`, `?? oodac/llvm_fntab.oo`,
`?? oodac/llvm_link_shim.oo`, `?? scripts/open68_stamp_smoke.oo`.
That is emit / shim / binop / fntab / env / ty / preamble / smoke.
This audit note is process, not product. Other dirty `oodac/llvm_emit*.oo`
