listing returns 0 (lines 251–254). Final `ret i32 %t123` (line 493). Source
`llvm_emit_fn.oo` has no `llvm_emit_listing_fresh_stub` (grep empty).
`llvm_link_shim.oo` has no `ret i32 1`. Source walk still in
`check_hash.oo` lines 43–102 (`byte_at` 10/9, `oo_file_stamp`, `now != old`).

