### C6 — `%OoStr` retain at entry; string NEQ inverted via xor — PASS
Non-main params: store then `call void @oo_str_retain(%OoStr %` + pn + `)`
(`llvm_emit_fn.oo` lines 201–203). IR: `check_listing_fresh` stores
`%listing` and retains it (`oodac_check_hash.oo.ll` lines 239–241).
`llvm_emit_binop.oo` lines 119–130: `oo_str_eq` then on `NEQ`
