433–434 (`%t102 = call i32 @oo_str_eq` then `%t103 = xor i32 %t102, 1`).
COORD: PV2/MEM already PASS live (warm ELF hello OK twice, changed hello
not OK, no intern abort, smoke PASSED twice). Scratch `asan.err` /
